      "description": "Interactive comparison of self-loop counts at perfect vs imperfect consonances, plus a live calculator for the voice-leading cost function and lattice conservation identity.",
      "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset='utf-8'><title>Bottleneck & Cost</title><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}body{font-family:'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;background:#0a0a1a;color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:20px;gap:15px}.title{font-size:22px;font-weight:700;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f59e0b,#ef4444);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent}.section{background:#1a1a2e;border:1px solid #333;border-radius:10px;padding:20px;max-width:700px;width:100%}.section h3{font-size:16px;margin-bottom:12px;color:#f59e0b}.bar-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:6px 0;font-size:13px}.bar-label{width:130px;text-align:right}.bar-container{flex:1;height:28px;background:#0f0f23;border-radius:4px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.bar-fill{height:100%;border-radius:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;padding-left:8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;transition:width 0.5s}.bar-val{position:absolute;right:8px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);font-size:11px;color:#aaa}.cost-calc{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:15px;margin-top:10px}.cost-input{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}.cost-input label{font-size:12px;color:#aaa}.cost-input input{background:#0f0f23;border:1px solid #444;color:#e0e0e0;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:4px;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px}.result-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;margin-top:12px}.result-box{background:#0f0f23;border:1px solid #2a2a4a;border-radius:6px;padding:10px;text-align:center}.result-box .val{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1}.result-box .lbl{font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-top:3px}.eq-box{background:#0a2e0a;border-color:#1a5c1a}.eq-box .val{color:#10b981}.neq-box{background:#2e0a0a;border-color:#5c1a1a}.neq-box .val{color:#ef4444}</style></head><body><div class='title'>Self-Loop Bottleneck & Cost Conservation</div><div class='section'><h3>Self-Loop Counts by Interval Type</h3><div id='bars'></div><div style='margin-top:10px;font-size:12px;color:#888'>Perfect consonances (P1, P5) admit only 1 self-loop — the identity (0,0).<br>Imperfect consonances (m3, M3, m6, M6) admit all 12 parallel self-loops.<br>This 12:1 ratio is the <em>bottleneck theorem</em>.</div></div><div class='section'><h3>Voice-Leading Cost Calculator</h3><p style='font-size:12px;color:#888;margin-bottom:8px'>Enter two voice motions as comma-separated integers (e.g., \"2,-3,1\"). The calculator verifies the lattice-cost conservation identity in real time.</p><div class='cost-calc'><div class='cost-input'><label>Motion m₁:</label><input id='m1' value='2,-3,1' oninput='calcCost()'></div><div class='cost-input'><label>Motion m₂:</label><input id='m2' value='-1,4,0' oninput='calcCost()'></div></div><div class='result-grid' id='results'></div></div><script>const intervals=[{name:'Unison (P1)',type:'perfect',loops:1},{name:'Minor 3rd (m3)',type:'imperfect',loops:12},{name:'Major 3rd (M3)',type:'imperfect',loops:12},{name:'Perfect 5th (P5)',type:'perfect',loops:1},{name:'Minor 6th (m6)',type:'imperfect',loops:12},{name:'Major 6th (M6)',type:'imperfect',loops:12}];const barsDiv=document.getElementById('bars');intervals.forEach(v=>{const row=document.createElement('div');row.className='bar-row';const pct=v.loops/12*100;const color=v.type==='perfect'?'#f59e0b':'#6366f1';row.innerHTML=`<div class='bar-label'>${v.name}</div><div class='bar-container'><div class='bar-fill' style='width:${pct}%;background:${color}'>${v.loops}</div></div>`;barsDiv.appendChild(row)});function parse(s){return s.split(',').map(x=>parseInt(x.trim())).filter(x=>!isNaN(x))}function cost(m){return m.reduce((s,x)=>s+Math.abs(x),0)}function vecOp(a,b,fn){const n=Math.max(a.length,b.length);return Array.from({length:n},(_, i)=>fn(a[i]||0,b[i]||0))}function calcCost(){const m1=parse(document.getElementById('m1').value);const m2=parse(document.getElementById('m2').value);if(m1.length===0||m2.length===0){document.getElementById('results').innerHTML='<div style=\"grid-column:1/-1;color:#888;font-size:12px\">Enter valid integer vectors.</div>';return}const meet=vecOp(m1,m2,Math.min);const join=vecOp(m1,m2,Math.max);const sum=vecOp(m1,m2,(a,b)=>a+b);const c1=cost(m1),c2=cost(m2),cMeet=cost(meet),cJoin=cost(join),cSum=cost(sum);const lhs=cMeet+cJoin,rhs=c1+c2;const conserved=lhs===rhs;const triangle=cSum<=c1+c2;const r=document.getElementById('results');r.innerHTML=`<div class='result-box'><div class='val'>${c1}</div><div class='lbl'>cost(m₁)</div></div><div class='result-box'><div class='val'>${c2}</div><div class='lbl'>cost(m₂)</div></div><div class='result-box'><div class='val'>${cSum}</div><div class='lbl'>cost(m₁+m₂) ${triangle?'≤':'>'} ${c1+c2}</div></div><div class='result-box'><div class='val'>${cMeet}</div><div class='lbl'>cost(m₁⊓m₂) = cost(${meet.join(',')})</div></div><div class='result-box'><div class='val'>${cJoin}</div><div class='lbl'>cost(m₁⊔m₂) = cost(${join.join(',')})</div></div><div class='result-box ${conserved?'eq-box':'neq-box'}'><div class='val'>${lhs} = ${rhs} ${conserved?'✓':'✗'}</div><div class='lbl'>Lattice Conservation</div></div>`}calcCost()</script></body></html>"
    }
  ]
}
